Recommends: qt6-wayland, ffmpeg, yt-dlp
Description: High-performance, lightweight native media player
 Top Player is a high-performance, lightweight native media player for Linux
 powered by Qt6 and libmpv: a borderless cyan-on-obsidian skin with an
 on-screen display, a seekbar with preview thumbnails, a playlist manager, an
 audio view with cover art and visualizations, synced lyrics, dual subtitles,
 a 10-band equalizer and subtitle downloads.
